    <string name="formats22_animation_message">%1$s-agi deg-s %2$s n yikataren. AN Paint yettbeddil tugniwin ur nettḥerrik ara, ur yettḥerrez ara amussu.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_poster">PNG-agi deg-s tugna tamezwert iman-is. D tugna-nni ara d-yettwaketren deg umkan n yikataren n umussu. Asekles ad d-yesnulfu tugna ur nettḥerrik ara.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_still">Ala akatar amezwaru ara d-yettwaketren. Asekles ad d-yesnulfu tugna ur nettḥerrik ara.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_title">Tugna yettḥerriken</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_unknown">%1$s-agi yeɛqed aṭas i usenqed ma deg-s ddeqs n yikataren. AN Paint ad d-yeldi kan tugna ur nettḥerrik ara, ur yettḥerrez ara ula d yiwen n umussu.</string>
    <string name="formats22_ascii_description">Yettaru aḍris aḥerfi s yisekkilen ifawen d wid yellan d imibriken. Sken-it s tsefsit ideg isekkilen sɛan yiwet n tehri. D tugna s yiḍrisen; ur tezmir ara ad t-id-teldiḍ d tugna taneṣlit.</string>
    <string name="formats22_open_still">Ldi tugna ur nettḥerrik ara</string>
    <string name="formats22_pdf_raster_hint">Isebtar n PDF ttwarendren s 144 dpi. Aḍris d tɣawsiwin tivekturiyin tuɣalen d ipiksilen.</string>
    <string name="gallery_credit_could_not_save">Isallen ɣef uɣbalu, ameskar d turagt n tugna ur zmiren ara ad ttuseklsen neɣ ad d-ttwarern. Isallen yettusekelsen yakan ttwaḥerzen. Ɛreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen.</string>
    <string name="gallery_credit_too_large">Isallen-agi ɣef uɣbalu, ameskar d turagt n tugna ad rren unuɣ meqqer aṭas i tririt-is. Unuɣ-ik yezrin d yisallen-is ɣef uɣbalu, ameskar d turagt ttwaḥerzen.</string>
    <string name="legacy_credits_unreadable">Kra n yisallen yettusekelsen ɣef uɣbalu, ameskar d turagt ur zmiren ara ad ttwaɣran. Inɣalen-nsen yettusekelsen ttwaḥerzen.</string>
    <string name="save20_destination_error">Tugna yemden ur tezmir ara ad tsemelsi afaylu n tɣerwaḍt-is.</string>
    <string name="save20_encoding_budget">Tugna d tallunin n usettengel ɛeddant tilist n tkatut i usifeḍ.</string>
    <string name="save20_gif_description">Tugna ur nettḥerrik ara, alamma 256 n yiniten. Aẓuzer n tneqqiḍin n yiniten yessiliɣ abeddel gar yiniten. GIF yettḥerriken yettwaldi d ukatar-is amezwaru.</string>
    <string name="save20_invalid_name">Sekcem isem n ufaylu war /, war \\ neɣ isekkilen n usenqed.</string>
    <string name="save20_lossy_quality_description">Taɣara yelhan ugar tettḥerrez ugar n telqayt, yerna s umata tettarra afaylu meqqer ugar.</string>
    <string name="save20_unsupported_image_colour">Tugna-agi tessemras alegdis n yini i ur yezmir ara AN Paint ad t-iselket akka tura. Selket-itt ɣer sRGB PNG deg umaẓrag yettsefraken initen send aktar-is.</string>
    <string name="ui_a_separate_recovery_copy_has_been_kept_use">%1$s Anɣal n tririt iman-is yettwaḥrez. Seqdec Afaylu &gt; Sifeḍ anɣal n tririt akken ad teskelseḍ ZIP-is. Ssef canvas.png seg-s, sakin sali tugna-nni akken ad tesqedceḍ iɣewwaṛen imagnuten n ubeddel n tiddi ma yella teḥwaǧeḍ.</string>
    <string name="ui_an_assembly_source_image_is_missing">Txuṣ tugna taɣbalut n usdukkel.</string>
    <string name="ui_assembly_saved">Asdukkel yettusekles</string>
    <string name="ui_assembly_source_memory_floor">Asdukkel-agi yettwaqder ad iɛeddi tilist n tkatut n umahil tamirant, ula s tiddi n tuffɣa tameẓẓyant akk. Asenqes n tisekta n usdukkel iman-is ur d-ikafi ara s tlisa timiranin. Mdel isemliyen-nniḍen neɣ heggi tugna taɣbalut tameẓẓyant ugar send aɛraḍ-nniḍen. Asdukkel-ik ur ibeddel ara.</string>
    <string name="ui_autosave_failed_use_save">Asekles awurman ur yeddi ara · seqdec Sekles</string>
    <string name="ui_autosave_image_encoding_failed">Asettengel n tugna n usekles awurman ur yeddi ara.</string>
    <string name="ui_autosave_is_paused_to_protect_that_draft_use">%1$s Asekles awurman yeḥbes i useḥbiber ɣef urewway-nni. Seqdec «Afaylu → Sifeḍ anɣal n tririt…» i uḥraz-is, d «Afaylu → Sekles am…» (Amasal n ufaylu: PNG / JPEG) i usekles n umahil-ik amiran.</string>
